---
/* How it works — four steps. */
---

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
        <h2>From your idea to your living room</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step reveal">
          <span class="step__num">01</span>
          <h3>Send us a message</h3>
          <p>Message us on WhatsApp with the piece you like — or the design in your head. Photos, measurements and floor plans all help.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step reveal" data-delay="1">
          <span class="step__num">02</span>
          <h3>Pick your finish</h3>
          <p>Choose colour, fabric and size. We'll advise on what works best for your space and your budget.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step reveal" data-delay="2">
          <span class="step__num">03</span>
          <h3>We build</h3>
          <p>5–10 working days on most pieces. Larger bespoke sets take longer — we keep you posted with progress photos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step reveal" data-delay="3">
          <span class="step__num">04</span>
          <h3>Delivered or picked up</h3>
          <p>Same-day delivery around Ibadan, nationwide delivery arranged, or collect from our Iyaganku showroom.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

